  "ai_summary": "This renewal for Ganga Leather & Footwear Industries Pvt. Ltd. (CPI/2026/00602) has been conditionally approved by the Senior Underwriter. The renewal features a Total Insured Value (TIV) of INR 112 Crore, well within the delegated authority. While the property presents material risks and high catastrophe exposure, driven by its industrial nature and location, significant mitigation efforts have recently been undertaken. These include a complete electrical rewiring, installation of a new sprinkler and fire suppression system, and upgraded CCTV, addressing previously noted electrical hazards. Though the risk score is medium (56) with a material risk flag and a high CAT score (70), the low previous claims count, comprehensive safety upgrades, and the proposal's direct broker channel contributed to the approval. The pricing incorporates a 25% loading for the identified material risks, with approval contingent on verifying documentation for electrical remediation, sprinkler system maintenance, chemical storage compliance, and completion of the latest safety inspection recommendations.",
